{"route":{"id":"17073","name":"Ruta a Cala Pedrosa","intro":"Aquesta ruta que ens porta fins a Cala Pedrosa ens permetrà, tot <strong>caminant entre pinedes de pi blanc, brolles i garrigars, gaudir d’àmplies vistes al massís del Montgrí i el seu litoral.</strong> El preciós <strong>camí de baixada a la cala és un oasi de tranquil·litat</strong> que convida a la calma, una calma que esperem podreu gaudir en arribar a aquesta petita cala. Si teniu temps i les forces us acompanyen, <strong>recomanem completar la ruta circular pujant fins als Estufadors, a on les vistes a la Foradada i el Cap Castell són espectaculars.</strong>","tipus":"Circular antihorari","dificultat":"Mitjana","durada":"2 hores 12 minuts","desnivell":"305.00 meters","distancia":"7.73 km","tema":"Flora i fauna, Paisatgístic","imgs":["n17073_1.jpg","n17073_2.jpg","n17073_3.jpg"],"url":"https://naturalocal.net/ca/rutes-senderisme-catalunya/rutes-senderisme-girona/rutes-senderisme-parc-natural-del-montgri-illes-medes-i-baix-ter/ruta-cala-pedrosa","track":[[42.0545,3.2016],[42.0546,3.20161],[42.05468,3.20161],[42.05482,3.20158],[42.05497,3.20158],[42.05508,3.20161],[42.05519,3.2016],[42.05522,3.20148],[42.05534,3.20141],[42.05536,3.20122],[42.05537,3.201],[42.05542,3.20084],[42.05546,3.20065],[42.05549,3.20049],[42.0555,3.2003],[42.0555,3.20009],[42.05554,3.19996],[42.05555,3.19986],[42.05555,3.19971],[42.05561,3.19954],[42.05563,3.19942],[42.05564,3.19925],[42.05565,3.19909],[42.05567,3.19902],[42.05572,3.19895],[42.05576,3.19879],[42.05584,3.19876],[42.056,3.19867],[42.05605,3.19857],[42.05606,3.19841],[42.05599,3.19824],[42.05598,3.19809],[42.05597,3.19797],[42.05607,3.19788],[42.05615,3.19779],[42.05623,3.19773],[42.05634,3.19764],[42.05644,3.19756],[42.05654,3.19745],[42.05663,3.19734],[42.0567,3.19725],[42.05671,3.19711],[42.0567,3.19695],[42.05669,3.19677],[42.05669,3.19665],[42.05676,3.19653],[42.05684,3.19637],[42.05694,3.19632],[42.05704,3.19626],[42.05713,3.19615],[42.05724,3.19606],[42.05734,